	(text "POTS AND GATE OUTPUTS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "134bd66c-4290-55b6-b868-75fb92baaaf2")
	)
	(text "Pots: MCP3208 on +3V3A with VREF = +3V3A, and the pot tops fed from the same rail (POT_TOP holes), so readings\nare ratiometric. Each wiper: 1 kΩ + 100 nF, 100 kΩ to ground so an unwired channel reads 0.\nGate outs: 74HCT595 at 5 V (VIH 2.0 V, so 3.3 V logic drives it) → 1 kΩ → jack, BAV99 clamps to +5VD and GND.\nOE is held high (outputs off) by a pull-up until firmware drives GATE_OE_N low: the 595's register powers up random."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.5 1.5))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "84360ef9-de11-5dff-961a-ce82433d6cfc")
	)
